  "prefLabel": "Plc 305.07 Duration of Temporary License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 305.07 Duration of Temporary License. As provided in RSA 310:6, V and RSA 332-G:14, IV, a temporary license issued under Plc 305.06 shall remain valid for 120 days or until final action is taken on an application for full licensure, whichever occurs first.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 300) #13606, eff 5-1-23; ss by #13955, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 300)",
